{"sba-keyaki-29385":{"blocks":[{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんばんは🎀"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"6月3日は、りぼん7月号の発売日です!"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHYP48GAD6TPHEDMW2TWB0BH","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n表紙は、「ハツコイと太陽」の小春子ちゃんです( ¨̮ )"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ハツコイと太陽は、\nJSの初々しい胸きゅん要素がたくさん詰まっている作品です🙈💓"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今月号の小春子ちゃん可愛かったな〜浴衣で夏祭りとか青春だ! \n今年は、ぺーちゃんから花火大会に誘われたので行ってきます(๑˃̵ᴗ˂̵)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"7月号の付録は、「ミルクステショセット」"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHYP49H3CYVKM6WA2YV2Z9TN","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\nベイビィミルクペン🐄いちごミルクマーカー🍓"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"バナナウユふせん🍌"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHYP4AGQRS7FGT8K8CMPQH94","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n私もバナナウユをよく飲みます!バナナの甘みが美味しいんだよね。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ミルクボトルジッパーバッグ🐄"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHYP4BEZZC6QS1DWWD0WBXQM","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\nインスタ映えもする便利なジッパーです!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"韓国っぽいオシャレなデザインでどれもとても可愛いです😍\nぜひ、皆さんも手に入れてみてね〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして今月は、なーこ先生[特別授業♪]四コマまんがのレシピというコーナーをやらせて頂きました!\n四コマまんがを描く時に気をつけてる4つのポイントが載っています✏︎\nR–4グランプリに応募する方は読んでみてくださいね〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"途中で諦めないことと、楽しんで描くことが一番大事な気がする☺️"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"完成したときの達成感がすごくあってやりがいも感じれると思うので是非、この夏に挑戦してみてね!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"読んでくれてありがとうございました。\nなーこ"}],"source":"archive"},"sba-hinata-35245":{"blocks":[{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":" \n \n \n こんばんは‪⸜(*ˊᵕˋ*)⸝‬\n \n 佐々木のみーぱんです！！\n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ4DGH32XE0Y6F9AQERMCG1B","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ4DGJ8J51Y69SJ67XEQ4RGY","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n  \n  \n みてみて〜。\n \n \n ついにloveTシャツを買ってしまいました！😳\n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n これ見つけた時、これは私のためだと思ったよね！\n \n 買わなくては！ってなりましたよ👀\n \n \n \n \n \n \n もちろん言葉でも伝えるけど、Tシャツでもloveを伝えて行こうかなと思います😘\n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n         ﾟ+o｡◈｡o+ﾟ+o｡◈｡o+ﾟ+o｡◈｡o+ﾟ+o｡◈｡o+\n \n \n \n そしてそして、アザトカワイイのMVの話なんですが、、、。\n \n \n みなさんにとっては小さいことだと思いますが、私にとっては大きな変化があります😶\n \n \n 気づきましたかね？？\n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ4DGKAZM7S226YHQQBYXHE3","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n 横の触覚(いっつも巻いてる長いやつ)がないのです🏋️‍♀️\n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n 私は、中学生くらいから触覚があったので、触覚卒業ということに自分も驚いてるし、友達と会っても、みれい触覚無くなったのね！びっくりだわ！って言われるくらい私のトレードマークでした😳\n \n \n \n \n \n 新しい髪型も楽しみポイントの1つです。\n \n 髪型といえば、MVでひよたんがハーフアップをしててね。\n \n \n \n それやるの初めてだったんですが、似合いすぎてて、お母さん(私)たくさん見ちゃいました😆😆\n \n \n \n \n \n かわいいのよ〜！！\n \n あとめーめーのぴょーんって跳ねてる三つ編みも好き。\n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n そしてもう1つ。\n \n メッセージのレターでもたくさん質問できていたんですが、、、。\n \n \n MVの最後なんて言ってるの？？\n \n \n \n \n \n みなさん気になりましたか？👀\n \n それはねーーー、秘密にしておきます☺️\n \n ちなみに、その言葉はね〜、歌詞読みながら私だったらなんて言うかなー？って想像して考えました✌🏻\n \n \n \n \n \n \n みなさん色んな言葉を当てはめて楽しんでください🐒\n \n \n いつか言おうかな〜！！\n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n 他にもね、いっぱい話したいことあるからそれはまた今度にしようかな〜。\n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n 最後にみんならぶ〜🥰\n \n \n 🍞佐々木美玲🍞"}],"source":"archive"},"crw-nogi-6158":{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近の癖。\n「人の顎を触ること」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shiraishi/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/27/9863621/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さゆりん...目で甘える\nかずみん...ポジティブスマイル\nななみん...小道具でアレンジ\nいこたん...(( _ _ ))..zzzZZ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"北海道キター！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"明日は個別ミニ握手会、北海道ラストです(o^^o)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"名古屋から始まって北海道。\n長旅だったけど凄く楽しい握手会だったし、毎週毎週皆さんに会えるのが凄く嬉しかったです！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"北海道ラストなので楽しむぞ〜☆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日はハッピーMusicの収録をしました"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"久しぶりに髪の毛編み込みカチューシャをしたよ(*^^*)\n放送をお楽しみに！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shiraishi/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/27/9863621/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日は写メいっぱいでした(^○^)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ばぁい(ฅ'ω'ฅ)♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shiraishi/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/27/9863621/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まいやん。"}],"source":"archive"},"crw-nogi-6200":{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつも読んでくださってる方、\n初めて読んでくださった方、\nコメントしてくださった方、\nありがとうございます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"新技術発表会in乃木坂ビル\n来てくださったみなさん\nありがとうございました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"世界初の3DARアプリ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/29/7080857/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさんも一緒に写真撮ろう"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/29/7080857/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いえあ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/29/7080857/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"万「そーや！トイレの洗面台で\nかざしたら正しい手の洗い方を\n教えてくれる！...\nみたいなのも良くない⁇」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"深「あー！キャラクターがやったら\n子供もきっと喜ぶよね！\n例えばア○パンマンとか\nド○えもんとか！」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"万「ア○パンマンは手しおれるし、\nド○えもんは常に手がグーだから\n無理だねうん！」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まいまいはて ん ね ん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"**********"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/29/7080857/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"狼の時まりかもねねころに\n負けへんぐらいどや顔してるん\n気づいてる？笑っ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/29/7080857/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でへっ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/29/7080857/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そん時だけはな！笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/29/7080857/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"自分磨きしてるんですか??"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/29/7080857/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"磨いて磨いて磨いて\nがんばります。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/29/7080857/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちなみにまりちゃんは\n一人でもビームだせるのかしら？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/29/7080857/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめかには負けます"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/29/7080857/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/29/7080857/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"←こうなる"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/29/7080857/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"俺も万理華Tシャツ届いたら\n裾の部分をダメージ加工しようか\nと思ってたんだ！\nでもどうやってダメージ入れればいいのかわかんなくて..."},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/29/7080857/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ハサミで軽く切ってから\n紙やすりでこするのがいちばん\n上手くいくんじゃないかしら"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/29/7080857/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"⁉"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/29/7080857/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちょっと変わった\nこだわりとか趣味ってありますか？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/29/7080857/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"爬虫類がすき"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/29/7080857/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"カメレオン飼ってみたい！\n服はちょっと変なデザインに\n惹かれます。\n髪はちょっとぼさってなってる\nくらいがちょうどいいです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/29/7080857/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"動物園と水族館どっちが好き？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/29/7080857/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まりっか→動物園\nしろくまりっくま→水族館"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どっちもすきってこと"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/29/7080857/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/29/7080857/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今回のセトリで万理華ちゃんの\nポジションはどこだったのカナ？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/29/7080857/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おいでシャンプー...せいたん\nぐるぐるカーテン...さゆりん\n会いたかったかもしれない...さゆりん\nあとの2曲は通常ポジでした"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/29/7080857/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"**********"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なかいさんビーム...\nおかしかったでしょ⁇"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あえてツッコまない方が\nいっぱいいたわね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/29/7080857/0011.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"2人ともビームの視線...\nみなさんに向けてないの笑\nビームの意味なし笑\nそれ撮ってて気づかんかった"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/29/7080857/0012.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも好評だったから\nひめかに報告しよーっと"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/29/7080857/0013.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"*****"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"体調の心配\nありがとうございました><"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日病院に行ったので\n熱は下がりました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"*****"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/29/7080857/0014.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"名古屋での伊藤ちゃんず\n髪型おそろっち"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/29/7080857/0015.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"明日も気合いで\n頑張りまりかぁぁあ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://jane